      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Calvin Jones sold 615 acres of forested land to the Baptist Convention for $2,000, enabling the founding of Wake Forest College.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
